[0.142, "o", "\u001b[2m              \"GARAGE_ADMIN_TOKEN\": \"fd7d139a9b95\",\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m              \"GARAGE_MET\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    smoke-app                http://smoke-app.harness.localhost       ana@padariaboavista.exampl\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.5, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.4, "o", "\u001b[1magent> Cloud instalada. Vou criar o app com slug `despesas` (dono: o e-mail admin da instalação,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1mjá que não foi indicado).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.394, "o", "\u001b[36m  Bash: ssh -F ~/.lima/cold/ssh.config lima-cold 'cd ~/open-company-app-harness && scripts/har …\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.459, "o", "\u001b[2m    PORT=8080\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    LOCAL_AUTH_MOCK_EMAIL=dev@example.com\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    LOCAL_AUTH_MOCK_NAME=Local Dev\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.5, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.4, "o", "\u001b[1magent> Agora escrevo o app (Node + `pg`, tabela criada no start, usuário vindo de `X-authentik-\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1memail`).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
