[1.5, "o", "\u001b[2m    [ok] despesas.harness.localhost/health answers 200 through the proxy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    [ok] anonymous requests to / are sent to the Authentik sign-in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    [ok] despesas is up at http://despesas.harness.localhost\u001b[0m\r\n"]
